    {
      "id": "REV10-X01",
      "key": "android-saf",
      "title": "SAF commit, rollback, lifecycle and resource boundaries",
      "evidence": [
        "android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/lexiquest/app/MainActivity.kt",
        "lib/features/export/data/file_selector_export_store.dart",
        "lib/features/export/domain/export_contracts.dart",
        "lib/features/export/application/export_use_cases.dart"
      ],
      "disposition": "write/flush/use-close all precede URI success. IOException/SecurityException attempt document deletion; failed deletion overrides with CLEANUP_FAILED, ENOSPC cause chain maps only after successful deletion. Dart checks cancellation after save and before finish; native removing unsettled URI is commit boundary. This does not promise cancellation after commit nor stable-media durability for arbitrary provider. REV10-01/02 retain lifecycle and responsiveness candidates. Single pending picker excludes overlap during picker, while URI set allows multiple unsettled completed writes. Suggested basename sanitization and active namespace bind are consistent. Legacy com.example activity is not the manifest target. No native provider execution."
    },
    {
      "id": "REV10-X02",
      "key": "android-config",
      "title": "Android permissions, build and release configuration",
      "evidence": [
        "android/app/build.gradle.kts",
        "android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml",
        "android/app/src/release/AndroidManifest.xml",
        "android/app/proguard-rules.pro",
        "android/settings.gradle.kts",
        "tool/cli/package-field-release.ps1"
      ],
      "disposition": "API26/compile36/Java17/desugar/multidex, nonexported notification receivers, optional camera/mic hardware and explicit runtime permissions match source contract. Release requires configured signing file/properties plus shape-valid commit/build/model values. This validates input shape, not authentic signer/model/installed flags; packaging/fingerprint verifier belongs REV11. Debug network override is not inherited by release/profile. Google-services Android identity matches active application; no OAuth/live auth assertion. Gradle wrapper lacks distribution checksum; supply-chain policy/provenance disposition remains REV11, not a new unsupported runtime claim."
    },
    {
      "id": "REV10-X03",
      "key": "apple",
      "title": "Apple scaffold versus supported release evidence",
      "evidence": [
        "ios/Runner.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj",
