      ],
      "disposition": "Linux copies assets/native libs and non-Debug AOT with relative rpath; nonunique GTK instance creates process isolation but does not prove application database multi-process correctness. Web base placeholder/bootstrap/PWA icons do not implement offline cache or prove browser compatibility of dart:io/native storage/plugin surfaces. Both remain unbuilt/uninstalled platform boundaries. No offline cold-start claim derives from a manifest or source-only CMake review."
    },
    {
      "id": "REV10-X06",
      "key": "offline",
