        "tool/cli/lib/release-profile.ps1",
        "docs/development/full-system/evidence/bundles/B18/G8.1-acceptance.json"
      ],
      "disposition": "Bootstrap availability catches initialization failure/2-second timeout and missing endpoint config becomes null; local owner/storage composition remains separate. Timeout does not cancel initializer; existing REV01 lifecycle ownership remains unchanged. Preview profile requires exact learning=true/cloud=false strings; source profile presence does not prove installed defines. G8.1 carries unsigned debug asset bundle with32asset/hash checks, not an APK/install/release runtime. Offline/device/plugin cold-start execution remains NOT RUN; final REV12 owns remaining bootstrap/shared oracles. No duplicate REV01/REV09 archive diagnostic finding."
    },
    {
      "id": "REV10-X07",
      "key": "oracles",
      "title": "Five exact domain oracles",
      "evidence": [
