        "test/config/app_config_test.dart",
        "test/config/flutter_dependency_surface_test.dart",
        "test/runtime/app_build_info_test.dart"
      ],
      "disposition": "Notification YAML pins/Android strings are config regressions, not reboot delivery. Android XML string checks allow absent optional manifests and cannot replace merged-manifest/native-network checks. AppConfig parser tests positive/negative local-debug and HTTPS origins without endpoint/TLS proof; its allowlist does not constrain every native plugin. Dependency regex covers direct names only, not lock/platform compatibility. AppBuildInfo mixed widget suite verifies injected disposal/resume/media-query behavior but fake preferences omit owner mutation guards. REV10-05 adds fallback/oracle mismatch; explicit release packaging injection prevents inference of installed release mismatch. No tests run."
    }
